<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay Jan-July exports up 16.2 pct vs yr-ago.</title>
<headline>Paraguay Jan-July exports up 16.2 pct vs yr-ago.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguayan exports were $680 million from January through July, up 16.2 percent from the same period last year, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>Exports were $74.5 million in July, down from the $79 million exported in the same month in 1995.</p>
<p>Figures on imports were not available.</p>
<p>-- Jose Maria Amarillla, Asuncion Newsroom 595 21 444527</p>
